        <mxCell id="c26" value="&lt;b&gt;먼저 볼 곳 (순서대로)&lt;/b&gt;&lt;br&gt;1. GET /readyz&lt;br&gt;2. GET /workerz (admin 키)&lt;br&gt;3. GET /api/v1/runtime-targets&lt;br&gt;4. GET /api/v1/maintenance&lt;br&gt;5. 진단 SQL (운영자 매뉴얼 5장)&lt;br&gt;6. 로그 검색어 (운영자 매뉴얼 4.3)" vertex="1" parent="1" style="text;html=1;whiteSpace=wrap;strokeColor=none;fillColor=none;fontFamily=Malgun Gothic;fontSize=12;align=left;verticalAlign=top;fontSize=11;">
